  <file id="dialogs\support\sgs_murderguards.txt" original="dialogs\support\sgs_murderguards.txt">
    <unit id="=&gt;q1" name="=&gt;q1">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">2</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="translated">&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q2" name="=&gt;q2">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">4</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Hey $(context.player.Name), maybe you don't want to go in there. It's really bad.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Гей $(context.player.Name), можливо, вам не варто туди йти. Там справді погано. &lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q3" name="=&gt;q3">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">6</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Bret was killed recently. Do you perhaps know anything that could help us find the killer?&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Брета нещодавно вбили. Чи знаєте ви щось, що могло б допомогти нам знайти вбивцю?&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q4" name="=&gt;q4">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">8</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Man, the Pierces are really unlucky. First Patrick, now Lenox...&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Чоловіче, Пірси справді нещасні. Спочатку Патрік, тепер Ленокс...&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q5" name="=&gt;q5">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">10</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>And now Tanner's gone... What's next?&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">І тепер Таннер зник... Що далі?&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q6" name="=&gt;q6">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">12</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Unbelievable, Lenox and Bret killed each other! What the hell is going on around here?&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Неможливо повірити, Ленокс і Брет вбили один одного! Що, в біса, тут відбувається?&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q7" name="=&gt;q7">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">14</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>I guess even SGS is not safe anymore...&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Гадаю, навіть SGS більше не в безпеці...&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q8" name="=&gt;q8">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">16</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>So, I haven't seen you in a while. How's life?&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Отже, я давно тебе не бачив. Як життя?&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q9" name="=&gt;q9">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">18</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>::Sighs.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">::Зітхає.::&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q10" name="=&gt;q10">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">20</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Heard about Gorsky's death in Core City?&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Чув про смерть Горського в Ядерному Місті?&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
